# If {{ bg.owner }} isn't available

This page explains the home network in plain language, for whoever needs it. You don't need to be technical. Last updated {{ generated }}.

## First: is it just the internet?

If nothing loads on any device, the problem is most likely the internet provider, not the equipment described here.

1. Unplug the modem and the router. Wait 30 seconds.
2. Plug the modem back in first. Wait until its lights settle (about 3 minutes).
3. Plug the router back in. Wait 5 more minutes and try again.
4. Still down? Call the internet provider.
{% if dns_servers %}

